                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.5212/39.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 15, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>57. Embassy’s 56, March 13. Copy of Azcona letter just received from Minister of
                    State who says that in view thereof, Caso incident may be considered closed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Willard</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
